<title>USA: Cott Corp sells $125 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Cott Corp sells $125 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Cott Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Cott Corp is the world's fourth-largest soft drink producer and the biggest private-label manufacturer.</p>
<p>BORROWER COTT CORP</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	   COUPON 8.50 PCT   MATURITY 5/01/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR UNSEC NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 11/01/97 LAST MOODY'S BA3     YIELD 8.50 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P B-PLUS	     SPREAD 196 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALL THREE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
